  "translation": "This afternoon, my mom and I went to the supermarket to buy fruit. The supermarket is south of my home. We walked for ten minutes and arrived. There were many people in the supermarket. I bought three apples and two cups of milk tea. Mom bought half a piece of bread. These fruits are all very good. It cost twenty yuan in total. I was very happy. We took the fruit and went home. After arriving home, I washed an apple and ate it. The apple was very delicious."
